	(text "Revision A    Date 2026-11-26    Doc No RR-EL-0102\n\nFive annunciator LEDs under 3 mm light pipes, SMD piezo sounder, landing for an optional\nexternal 22 mm panel sounder.  Passive board: the low-side drivers are on RR-CHS-MAIN (J_PANEL).\nNetlist = electronics/panel/design/circuit.py (stage 1), imported without overrides.\n\nLayers: 2    Thickness: 1.60 mm\nRails: GND, V12_AUX, V5_AUX\nNet class POWER: track 0.40 mm, clearance 0.20 mm, via 0.60/0.30 mm  [V5_AUX, V12_AUX, GND]\nNet class SIGNAL: track 0.25 mm, clearance 0.20 mm, via 0.60/0.30 mm  [LED_*, BUZ_*]\n\nThis schematic is generated from board.py by tools/eda (rrkicad).\nAll nets are connected by name (global labels / power symbols); there are no drawn wires between symbols."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 29 0)
